{"id":"665537","name":"奇亚籽藜麦杂蔬鸡蛋沙拉","author":"polaris滴食记","authorId":"10301589","desc":"","cover":"images/665537/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"小番茄","amount":"50克"},{"name":"熟三色藜麦","amount":"100克"},{"name":"干黑木耳","amount":"5克"},{"name":"生菜","amount":"5片"},{"name":"白煮蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"奇亚籽","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"生抽","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"醋","amount":"2勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"沙拉碗内倒入100克熟三色藜麦。","img":"images/665537/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入洗净切半的小番茄。","img":"images/665537/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入洗净手撕成片的生菜放入泡发汆烫。","img":"images/665537/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入泡发汆烫好的黑木耳。","img":"images/665537/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入煮熟的切成丁的白煮蛋。","img":"images/665537/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入2勺醋。","img":"images/665537/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入1勺生抽。","img":"images/665537/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅拌均匀之后撒上一些奇亚籽即可。","img":"images/665537/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/665537/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}